\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] to account for impersonal sentences; almost all impersonal 
sentences  can go trough this transformation, but the rule is crucial for 
reflexives, constructions with [-animate] pronominal Direct Objects and 
constructions with pronominal Indirect and Direct Object, which cannot 
get the impersonal SEconstruction. 
